{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The room is White, the boxes are White, the Floor is White, can you find your way to the coloured rooms and escape the mind bending 4 dimensional maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on moving through a world in 3D but carefully constructed to simulate a 4D space. Many secret achievements can be found featuring rabbits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox Controller Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4D Maze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets that lead to achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Ray Tracing support even without high end hardware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-playability, you may not experience every part of the game on one playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game made in Wales.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1245800?t=1752672254","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1245800?t=1752672254","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1245800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752672254","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1245800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752672254","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3660950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The room is White, the boxes are White, the Floor i